# PRRO Gateway Dev Pack v1.2

Current state:
- canonical models and schemas
- SQLite storage and repositories
- staged write-path worker pipeline
- offline, excise, audit, trace foundation
- adapters for Checkbox/WebCheck/Maria mapping
- transport router and reconciliation scaffold
- runtime shells (REST/XML-RPC/Maria)
- runtime metrics, alert persistence and structured logging
- config env overrides and graceful shutdown hooks

